                    <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-warning fs-3">inventory</span>
                    <span class="badge bg-secondary text-white fw-bold extra-small">Custom Packing</span>
                </div>
                <h4 class="fw-bold fs-6 mb-1">Loose &amp; Retail Packaging</h4>
                <p class="extra-small text-muted mb-2">Custom bag weights tailored for supermarkets and retail store stocks.</p>
                <span class="text-warning fw-bold extra-small d-inline-flex align-items-center gap-1">
